        "content": "<p>There's a huge library for this in rocq: <a href=\"https://c-corn.github.io/\">https://c-corn.github.io/</a>, <a href=\"https://math-classes.github.io/\">https://math-classes.github.io/</a> (I'm one of the authors). There were some initiatives porting/connecting this to Lean. I had also been considering doing that at some point, but I have plenty of other projects. :-) I'd be happy to give some pointers.</p>",
